flowchart TD
    A[device_runs.zst] --> R[TempPackage.read]
    B[rgb_samples.zst] --> R
    C[radar_pc_samples.zst] --> R
    R --> V[Input validation]
    V --> T[TempToCanonicalTransformer]
    T --> S[SUBJECT / DEVICE_RUN / RUN_SAMPLE]
    T --> A2[RUN_ASSET]
    T --> M[RUN_TIMELINE_MODEL]
    T --> E[SAMPLE_TIME_ESTIMATE]
    S --> DB[(SQLite store)]
    A2 --> DB
    M --> DB
    E --> DB
    T --> REP[Reports]

    DB --> LEGACY[ArtifactBuildService: legacy packages only]
    R --> LEGACY
    LEGACY --> LNPZ[Run-level NPZ / JSONL bundles]
    LEGACY --> LMETA[RUN_ASSET / SAMPLE_ARTIFACT / SAMPLE_SUMMARY]
    LMETA --> DB

    OLD[(Existing canonical database)] --> MIGRATE[migrate-point-clouds: copy then migrate]
    MIGRATE --> VDB[(Migrated database copy)]
    RAW[radar_raw_samples.zst + radar_raw_point_cloud_versions.json] --> CHECK[RawCloudPackage: checksum and contract validation]
    A --> CHECK
    CHECK --> IMPORT[RawPointCloudImportService]
    VDB --> IMPORT
    IMPORT --> ACQ[Verify/reuse acquisition samples and timeline; add missing raw acquisition rows]
    IMPORT --> BUNDLE[Immutable point_cloud_versions/version_id/points.npz]
    IMPORT --> VMETA[POINT_CLOUD_VERSION + versioned assets/artifacts/summaries]
    ACQ --> VDB
    VMETA --> VDB
    MIGRATE --> REG[Register online_original / available raw_legacy payloads]
    REG --> VDB
    %% Versioned import requires an existing subject and a migrated schema.
    %% Legacy ingest/build commands reject the versioned raw package.
